DESCRIPTION:Title of Presentation: "Bifidobacterium Longum Subspecies Infa
 ntis\; The Bacterium That Wasn't There" \n\nThe Duke Department of Pediat
 rics holds its weekly Grand Rounds lecture on Tuesday mornings from 8 to 
 9 a.m. | Lectures are delivered to an in-person audience in Conference Ro
 om DHN 2002 as well as virtually via Zoom. Physicians who attend Grand Ro
 unds are eligible to receive CME credit.
