DESCRIPTION:Former President of Costa Rica\, Carlos Alvarado Quesada\, wil
 l share his journey of integrating democratic values with environmental s
 tewardship\, highlighting Costa Rica's global leadership in sustainable p
 olicies.\n\nAlvarado will speak at Duke as part of the Crown Lecture in E
 thics Series. Endowed by Lester Crown\, this prestigious lecture brings s
 peakers to campus to discuss the ethical implications of issues in the ar
 ts\, sciences\, medicine\, business and other fields. Event partners for 
 this lecture include the Sanford School of Public Policy\, the Nicholas S
 chool of the Environment and the Sanford Latin America and Caribbean grou
 p (SLAC). For questions about this event\, please feel free to email sanf
 ordevents@duke.edu.
DURATION:PT1H
